---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Packages — VidMedical"
  description="Medical explainer video packages for health practices. Mix simple edits and animated explainers. Start with one video or go monthly."
>
  <section class="bg-paper">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-24">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-signal">Packages</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 max-w-2xl font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-5xl">
        Build the month that fits your feed.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-muted leading-relaxed">
        Same studio, two craft modes you can mix: polished clinician-on-camera edits and animated
        medical explainers. A live package builder is coming next — for now, start from these
        anchors and we’ll confirm scope by email.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-14 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="flex flex-col border border-ink/10 bg-mist p-6 md:p-8">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted">Try us</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Single video</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">
            One explainer — simple edit or animated — so you can judge fit before a monthly block.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-6 font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-ink">From ~$200</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted">Final quote depends on edit type &amp; inputs</p>
          <ul class="mt-6 flex-1 space-y-2 text-sm text-ink-soft">
            <li>30–60s vertical delivery</li>
            <li>Basic thumbnail</li>
            <li>2 revision rounds</li>
            <li>Prepaid · non-refundable</li>
          </ul>
          <a
            href="/contact?interest=single"
            class="mt-8 inline-flex justify-center rounded-full bg-ink px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-paper no-underline hover:bg-ink-soft"
          >
            Request a single
          </a>
        </article>

        <article class="flex flex-col border-2 border-signal bg-paper p-6 shadow-[0_20px_50px_-30px_rgba(31,138,122,0.55)] md:p-8">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-signal">Most practices</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Core monthly</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">
            About one short a week — the cadence most solo HCPs can actually sustain.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-6 font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-ink">4 videos / mo</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted">Typical band ~$800–1,400 · mix edit types</p>
          <ul class="mt-6 flex-1 space-y-2 text-sm text-ink-soft">
            <li>Ready-to-post files (you publish)</li>
            <li>Email-led briefing &amp; feedback</li>
            <li>Invoiced monthly via Payoneer</li>
            <li>Cancel before next billing date</li>
          </ul>
          <a
            href="/contact?interest=core"
            class="mt-8 inline-flex justify-center rounded-full bg-signal px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-ink no-underline hover:bg-signal-bright"
          >
            Start Core
          </a>
        </article>

        <article class="flex flex-col border border-ink/10 bg-mist p-6 md:p-8">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted">Higher cadence</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Growth monthly</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">
            About two shorts a week when you want stronger presence without a full social agency.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-6 font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-ink">8 videos / mo</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted">Typical band ~$1,400–2,200 · mix edit types</p>
          <ul class="mt-6 flex-1 space-y-2 text-sm text-ink-soft">
            <li>Same craft standards as Core</li>
            <li>Room to mix animated + on-camera</li>
            <li>Still video-only — no feed management</li>
            <li>Prepaid month · non-refundable</li>
          </ul>
          <a
            href="/contact?interest=growth"
            class="mt-8 inline-flex justify-center rounded-full bg-ink px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-paper no-underline hover:bg-ink-soft"
          >
            Start Growth
          </a>
        </article>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-10 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Prices are orientation bands while we finish the interactive builder (edit type, scripting,
        quantity, monthly repeat). Exact totals confirmed before you pay. We deliver videos — posting
        stays with you unless we agree an add-on later.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
